                     :purpose "What a scenario is MADE of: the ordered Actions a replay would re-apply, plus any log entries it could NOT reproduce. the Action list IS the scenario, the fork is what evaluating it produces."
                     :when "Before rebuilding or duplicating one, and to see WHY a rebuild refuses."
                     :examples ["scenario-actions wochenvorschau 3f2a1b.QW5uYSBUZWlsemVpdA"]
