                     :examples ["scenario-rebuild wochenvorschau 3f2a1b.QW5uYSBUZWlsemVpdA"]
                     :see-also [:scenario-actions :scenario-duplicate]}
  :scenario-apply {:theme :orient
                   :purpose "Apply a scenario: its Action list runs against the BASE for real — writebacks to the source system included — and the scenario is sealed as the record of what was applied. Until this, a fork's writeback is only DEFERRED: the edit stands in the fork, the source system has heard nothing. All-or-nothing — the list is first replayed on a throwaway fork of the base, so an action that cannot run today fails before anything lands."
                   :when "A what-if is decided and is to become the real state."
                   :examples ["scenario-apply wochenvorschau 3f2a1b.QW5uYSBUZWlsemVpdA"]
                   :see-also [:scenario-actions :scenario-rebuild :scenario-seal]}
